  "characterPolicy": "Approved source roster and owner uncertainty decisions retained. Known sex uses Romanian masculine/feminine agreement at the source disclosure point. Unknown roles use voce, persoană and active clauses; grammatical gender follows these nouns, not invented biological sex. Generic profession/participant nouns and literal-code possessives do not establish sex. Adolescent entrance label uses persoana adolescentă with agreement to persoană. Cat is generic pisica with explicit кот/он source evidence and unknown biological sex. Death keeps feminine references and poetic frate separately. Two spouses and two sisters remain two participants.",
